  message: "Fix shipped on branch jgstern-agent/fix/inv-zudob-class-containing-id (commit 9dfec82496). Empirical impact on self-analysis: cross-module class collision rate 18.94% → 1.76% (91% reduction); all 76 residual collisions are same-file identical-body groups (e.g., 12x MockEdge in test_io_boundary.py, 8x Args in test_cli_commands.py), preserved by design per the (stable_id, canonical_name) docstring contract. Quantitative-claim PR per bakeoff-validation-tagging-discipline; needs BROAD-cohort confirmation that the prospector corpus sees comparable reductions before final closure."  # 57ee
